    <name>IRONMAN 70.3 Power Ups</name>
    <description>Warm Up:
5 mins in Z1-2,
5 x (15 secs in Z3, 15 secs Z1-2, 15 secs in Z4, 15 secs in Z1-2)
5 mins in Z2.</description>
